# What is left out of the Docker build context (the repository root). Keeps the
# image small and, more importantly, keeps secrets and local state out of it.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
.git
.github
.claude
docs

# Never bake configuration into an image. (The example file is fine, and harmless.)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Local scratch files, and a Prisma client generated on a developer's machine -
# the image generates its own, for its own operating system.
**/tmp-*
apps/api/src/generated

# The web app is deployed separately; only its package.json is needed, so npm can read the workspace.
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
